Below is one way to modify your LaunchedEffect so that whenever the thumbs are moved, you adjust the values if they’re about to cross. (In this example I assume that if they “collide” the thumb being dragged will stop at a minimum distance defined by stepSize.) You may need to experiment with which thumb to “move” (or which value to clamp) if you’d like slightly different behavior.

